74
00:08:15,067 --> 00:08:16,067
Huh?

75
00:08:17,067 --> 00:08:18,067
Murhi!

76
00:08:19,067 --> 00:08:21,067
You can be dried squid instead!

77
00:08:22,067 --> 00:08:23,067
Wait, what's going on?

78
00:08:23,067 --> 00:08:24,067
I can't move!

79
00:08:24,067 --> 00:08:25,067
Somebody help me!

80
00:08:26,067 --> 00:08:27,067
Anybody!

81
00:08:31,067 --> 00:08:32,067
Nami?

82
00:08:32,067 --> 00:08:33,067
Oh, that's right!

83
00:08:33,067 --> 00:08:34,067
Here you go!

84
00:08:34,067 --> 00:08:36,067
Say hello to the squid spear!

85
00:08:39,067 --> 00:08:41,067
While you're standing there, could I see your pet-

86
00:08:45,067 --> 00:08:46,067
So you're on their side.

87
00:08:47,067 --> 00:08:49,067
Well, I'm glad I stabbed you then.

88
00:08:49,067 --> 00:08:51,067
I'll drain you dry, hee!

89
00:08:52,067 --> 00:08:53,067
Huh?

90
00:08:54,067 --> 00:08:55,067
What's the matter?

91
00:08:55,067 --> 00:08:59,067
When my spear stabs you, you're supposed to bleed out and turn into dry squid!

92
00:09:01,067 --> 00:09:03,067
What am I doing wrong?

93
00:09:03,067 --> 00:09:04,067
Come on!

94
00:09:04,067 --> 00:09:07,067
Why, why, why, why, why, why, why, why, why, why, why, why?

95
00:09:08,067 --> 00:09:10,067
Tell me, hee!

96
00:09:12,067 --> 00:09:13,067
Well...

97
00:09:14,067 --> 00:09:17,067
Being a skeleton, I'm already dry as a bone.

98
00:09:18,067 --> 00:09:20,067
You're what?!

99
00:09:20,067 --> 00:09:21,067
Ugh!

100
00:09:21,067 --> 00:09:23,067
But how can that be, hee!

101
00:09:23,067 --> 00:09:25,067
It is a rather complicated concept.

102
00:09:25,067 --> 00:09:29,067
But, if you must know, when people died, their skin rots and-

103
00:09:29,067 --> 00:09:31,067
That's not what I was talking about!

104
00:09:31,067 --> 00:09:32,067
Oh, I see.

105
00:09:32,067 --> 00:09:33,067
Well, about 50 years ago...

106
00:09:33,067 --> 00:09:34,067
Oh, I see.

107
00:09:34,067 --> 00:09:35,067
Well, about 50 years ago...

108
00:09:36,067 --> 00:09:37,067
Geez!

109
00:09:37,067 --> 00:09:41,067
What's the point of having a badass robot if everybody's too chicken to fight it?

110
00:09:41,067 --> 00:09:42,067
Huh?

111
00:09:42,067 --> 00:09:48,067
Oh, are you okay, boss?

112
00:09:48,067 --> 00:09:49,067
Who are you?

113
00:09:49,067 --> 00:09:50,067
Frankie!

114
00:09:50,067 --> 00:09:51,067
Frankie!

115
00:09:51,067 --> 00:10:01,067
Come on, you don't know a super guy like me?

116
00:10:01,067 --> 00:10:04,067
Ah, you're one of their officers, ain't ya?

117
00:10:04,067 --> 00:10:07,067
You should have the backbone to fight me at least!

118
00:10:07,067 --> 00:10:11,067
I'm a squid, but I've got backbone!

119
00:10:12,067 --> 00:10:13,067
Backbone?

120
00:10:13,067 --> 00:10:15,067
We have that in common!

121
00:10:15,067 --> 00:10:16,067
My brother!

122
00:10:16,067 --> 00:10:18,067
You're such a bonehead!

123
00:10:18,067 --> 00:10:19,067
Hey, skeleton!

124
00:10:20,067 --> 00:10:22,067
I'd move away from there if I were you!

125
00:10:22,067 --> 00:10:23,067
Huh?

126
00:10:23,067 --> 00:10:24,067
Why's that?

127
00:10:24,067 --> 00:10:26,067
Just... move!

128
00:10:26,067 --> 00:10:27,067
Why did I step in?

129
00:10:28,067 --> 00:10:30,067
Um... his face!

130
00:10:33,067 --> 00:10:35,067
Whoa, what's he doing there?

131
00:10:35,067 --> 00:10:38,067
He must have been the reason I couldn't move my legs!

132
00:10:38,067 --> 00:10:39,067
Oh, hello.

133
00:10:39,067 --> 00:10:41,067
And who might you be?

134
00:10:45,067 --> 00:10:46,067
How did you like that?

135
00:10:47,067 --> 00:10:48,067
Huh?

136
00:10:48,067 --> 00:10:51,067
You've just suffered a devastating headbutt to your foot!

137
00:10:54,067 --> 00:10:55,067
Uh...

138
00:10:56,067 --> 00:10:58,067
Prepare to enter a world of pain!

139
00:10:58,067 --> 00:11:00,067
Yes, any moment now!

140
00:11:02,067 --> 00:11:04,067
He can't admit he's getting stepped on!

141
00:11:04,067 --> 00:11:06,067
I'm sorry I stepped on you!

142
00:11:07,067 --> 00:11:08,067
He said it!

143
00:11:08,067 --> 00:11:09,067
Uh-oh!

144
00:11:09,067 --> 00:11:13,067
It's a special technique I developed for delivering a headbutt where you least expect it!

145
00:11:14,067 --> 00:11:15,067
I call it...

146
00:11:16,067 --> 00:11:17,067
The Super Soul Headbutt!

147
00:11:18,067 --> 00:11:19,067
Don't give it a name!

148
00:11:22,067 --> 00:11:24,067
Come out, come out, wherever you are!

149
00:11:25,067 --> 00:11:26,067
It's time for some payback!

150
00:11:26,067 --> 00:11:27,067
Cha-cha!

151
00:11:28,067 --> 00:11:29,067
You're no match for me underground!

152
00:11:30,067 --> 00:11:32,067
Now I'm gonna chew you up and spit you out!

153
00:11:33,067 --> 00:11:34,067
Star rumor!

154
00:11:35,067 --> 00:11:38,067
If you're not careful, there won't be any ground left for us to stand on!

155
00:11:39,067 --> 00:11:41,067
You don't have to dig that many tunnels, do you?

156
00:11:41,067 --> 00:11:42,067
All right!

157
00:11:42,067 --> 00:11:43,067
Hey, Chopper!

158
00:11:43,067 --> 00:11:44,067
You all done?

159
00:11:44,067 --> 00:11:45,067
Need some help out here!

160
00:11:46,067 --> 00:11:47,067
Heh!

161
00:11:47,067 --> 00:11:48,067
I bet I can catch this guy off guard!

162
00:11:49,067 --> 00:11:50,067
Oh boy!

163
00:11:50,067 --> 00:11:51,067
Almost too easy!

164
00:11:51,067 --> 00:11:52,067
Hey!

165
00:11:52,067 --> 00:11:53,067
Chopper!

166
00:11:53,067 --> 00:11:54,067
Jeez, can he hear me?

167
00:11:55,067 --> 00:12:10,067
I'll crush you into the ground, Simpson!

168
00:12:11,067 --> 00:12:12,067
Oh, so, look out!

169
00:12:15,067 --> 00:12:16,067
Oh!

170
00:12:17,067 --> 00:12:18,567
Oh!

171
00:12:19,067 --> 00:12:20,067
Nice going!

172
00:12:20,067 --> 00:12:22,067
So are all the tunnels connected?

173
00:12:22,067 --> 00:12:23,067
Yeah, we're good to go!

174
00:12:23,067 --> 00:12:23,907
Good to go.

175
00:12:23,907 --> 00:12:25,067
Sweet.

176
00:12:25,067 --> 00:12:29,567
Now, special attack, Green Star.

177
00:12:37,407 --> 00:12:39,827
Wait for it, Skull Bomb Grass.

178
00:12:45,747 --> 00:12:47,347
Too bad for you, Shorty.

179
00:12:48,227 --> 00:12:50,667
We already fought a tunnel digger back in Alabasta,

180
00:12:50,667 --> 00:12:52,287
so we're pros now.

181
00:12:54,067 --> 00:12:56,447
Practice makes perfect, am I right?

182
00:12:56,447 --> 00:12:57,567
Uh-huh.

183
00:12:57,567 --> 00:12:58,947
Yeah, yeah!

184
00:12:58,947 --> 00:13:01,747
You trying to make fools out of us?

185
00:13:01,747 --> 00:13:03,587
You screwed up my hard work!

186
00:13:03,587 --> 00:13:06,787
I'm gonna pulverize you like the little bug you are!

187
00:13:06,787 --> 00:13:09,587
I can do some pulverizing myself!

188
00:13:09,587 --> 00:13:12,947
I'll bite that ugly nose off!

189
00:13:12,947 --> 00:13:15,187
Yeah, it's too bad you can't reach it.

190
00:13:15,187 --> 00:13:16,687
Pack me up here, Chopper.

191
00:13:20,127 --> 00:13:21,867
Are you still there?

192
00:13:23,067 --> 00:13:24,567
Uh-oh.

193
00:13:24,567 --> 00:13:26,407
Heya, buddy!

194
00:13:26,407 --> 00:13:30,447
Looks like it's my turn now!

195
00:13:30,447 --> 00:13:31,747
Cuckoo!

196
00:13:31,747 --> 00:13:32,547
He-he-he!

197
00:13:32,547 --> 00:13:34,247
Come down!

198
00:13:34,247 --> 00:13:34,807
He-he-he!

199
00:13:34,807 --> 00:13:58,807
Ready, hee!

200
00:13:58,807 --> 00:14:02,807
Stupid head, now you've made me angry!

201
00:14:02,807 --> 00:14:04,807
I'm gonna beat you up good!

202
00:14:04,807 --> 00:14:08,807
You might even cry!

203
00:14:08,807 --> 00:14:11,807
That's it! I like your style, kid!

204
00:14:11,807 --> 00:14:14,807
Finally I get to really let loose!

205
00:14:32,807 --> 00:14:42,807
Oh no! Let me treat your injuries!

206
00:14:42,807 --> 00:14:56,807
Oh no! Let me treat your injuries!

207
00:14:56,807 --> 00:14:58,807
It's okay dear, don't cry!

208
00:14:58,807 --> 00:15:00,807
Daddy!

209
00:15:00,807 --> 00:15:02,807
Over here! He needs help!

210
00:15:02,807 --> 00:15:08,807
Damn it, Horty! These people weren't even armed! How the hell could you do this to them?

211
00:15:08,807 --> 00:15:11,807
Her Majesty, is she safe now?

212
00:15:11,807 --> 00:15:18,807
I've got no idea. I wish I did. But wherever she is, I'm sure she's fighting for us.

213
00:15:18,807 --> 00:15:24,807
Madam Charlie, what's gonna happen to Fish Man Island? Are we gonna die?

214
00:15:24,807 --> 00:15:30,807
What about the guy with the straw hat? Is he gonna come back here and save us?

215
00:15:30,807 --> 00:15:34,807
I'm scared, Madam Charlie! Say something!

216
00:15:34,807 --> 00:15:36,807
We should pray.

217
00:15:36,807 --> 00:15:37,807
Huh?

218
00:15:37,807 --> 00:15:42,807
All we can do is pray Princess Shirohoshi and the others are safe.

219
00:15:42,807 --> 00:15:44,807
We're helpless.

220
00:15:44,807 --> 00:15:49,807
If we lose them, then we've lost all hope of survival.

221
00:16:14,807 --> 00:16:27,807
So....

222
00:16:27,807 --> 00:16:29,807
Heh. So desperate.

223
00:16:29,807 --> 00:16:34,807
Stay away from the island, Noah! Please!

224
00:16:36,807 --> 00:16:37,807
Shirahose!

225
00:16:37,807 --> 00:16:39,807
If the Noah falls now, it's all over!

226
00:16:39,807 --> 00:16:41,807
It's all over!

227
00:16:44,807 --> 00:16:46,807
No! She came here!

228
00:16:46,807 --> 00:16:48,807
Stop swimming upward!

229
00:16:48,807 --> 00:16:52,807
Sister! You have to change your course before it's too late!

230
00:16:52,807 --> 00:16:54,807
They figured it out!

231
00:16:55,807 --> 00:16:57,807
Shirohoshi!

232
00:16:57,807 --> 00:16:59,807
Touchplacer!

233
00:17:02,807 --> 00:17:04,807
Brother Nye!

234
00:17:04,807 --> 00:17:06,807
Ryuboshi!

235
00:17:06,807 --> 00:17:08,807
The plan is set. Do not interfere.

236
00:17:09,807 --> 00:17:12,807
Hey! Hey! Hold on!

237
00:17:12,807 --> 00:17:15,807
If Decken dies, his ability will stop working.

238
00:17:15,807 --> 00:17:18,807
You see, I stabbed him so that the Noah would fall.

239
00:17:20,807 --> 00:17:22,807
So that's it!

240
00:17:22,807 --> 00:17:24,807
If she keeps swimming straight up,

241
00:17:24,807 --> 00:17:27,807
the ship's just gonna crash right into the island!

242
00:17:27,807 --> 00:17:29,807
No matter how far away she swims,

243
00:17:29,807 --> 00:17:32,807
the problem's just gonna get worse!

244
00:17:32,807 --> 00:17:33,807
After her!

245
00:17:33,807 --> 00:17:35,807
We gotta go tell her what to do!

246
00:17:35,807 --> 00:17:36,807
Right!

247
00:17:37,807 --> 00:17:39,807
Shirohoshi!

248
00:17:39,807 --> 00:17:41,807
Winky Hoshi!

249
00:17:45,807 --> 00:17:46,807
Stop right there.

250
00:17:46,807 --> 00:17:48,807
I won't let you ruin this.

251
00:17:48,807 --> 00:17:50,807
