255
00:17:57,807 --> 00:17:59,807
Stay with me!

256
00:17:59,807 --> 00:18:01,807
Shirohoshi!

257
00:18:01,807 --> 00:18:04,807
You've gotta swim through the side!

258
00:18:04,807 --> 00:18:06,807
Sister!

259
00:18:06,807 --> 00:18:08,807
Sister!

260
00:18:22,807 --> 00:18:24,807
She... she heard you!

261
00:18:24,807 --> 00:18:25,807
Yes.

262
00:18:27,807 --> 00:18:28,807
Useless mermaid!

263
00:18:28,807 --> 00:18:30,807
This isn't over!

264
00:18:30,807 --> 00:18:32,807
She's pulling away from the island!

265
00:18:32,807 --> 00:18:34,807
And just in time, too!

266
00:18:34,807 --> 00:18:35,807
You're getting on my nerves.

267
00:18:37,807 --> 00:18:39,807
I'll make you pay for that!

268
00:18:39,807 --> 00:18:41,807
I don't think so!

269
00:18:46,807 --> 00:18:47,807
You brat!

270
00:18:47,807 --> 00:18:48,807
